#: data/text/pokemon_news.inc:2
msgctxt "gPokeNewsTextSlateport_Upcoming"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"It's time for POKéMON NEWS.\p"
"SLATEPORT's most popular kind of guy,\n"
"the ENERGY GURU, is in the news again!\p"
"He promises to, “Stupendously go for\n"
"it in just this many days: {STR_VAR_1}!”\p"
"While he refused to elaborate on what\n"
"he will stupendously go for, the\l"
"ENERGY GURU advised, “Save up your\l"
"money. That'll be good…”\p"
"It sounds like a trip to SLATEPORT\n"
"would be well worth your while that day.\p"
"That's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"
msgstr ""
"大家好！\n"
"宝可梦新闻时间到了。\p"
"凯那市最受欢迎的人物——\n"
"活力大师又上新闻了！\p"
"他承诺：“再过{STR_VAR_1}天，\n"
"我就要大干一场！”\p"
"虽然他拒绝透露要大干什么，\n"
"但活力大师建议大家：\l"
"“把钱存好。会有好事的……”\p"
"看来那天去一趟凯那市\n"
"一定很值得。\p"
"以上就是宝可梦新闻。$"

#: data/text/pokemon_news.inc:17
msgctxt "gPokeNewsTextSlateport_Ongoing"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"It's time for POKéMON NEWS.\p"
"This is the news you've all been\n"
"waiting for!\p"
"SLATEPORT'S ENERGY GURU is going\n"
"for it stupendously in the MARKET!\p"
"He promises unbeatable bargain\n"
"prices on CALCIUM and PROTEIN!\p"
"A trip to SLATEPORT CITY sounds\n"
"worthwhile. Why not visit and shop\l"
"to your heart's content?\p"
"That's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"
msgstr ""
"大家好！\n"
"宝可梦新闻时间到了。\p"
"这是大家期待已久的消息！\p"
"凯那市的活力大师\n"
"正在市场里大干一场！\p"
"他承诺特攻增强剂和攻击增强剂\n"
"将以无敌的低价出售！\p"
"去一趟凯那市应该很值得。\n"
"何不去尽情购物呢？\p"
"以上就是宝可梦新闻。$"

#: data/text/pokemon_news.inc:31
msgctxt "gPokeNewsTextSlateport_Ending"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"It's time for POKéMON NEWS.\p"
