#: data/text/pokemon_news.inc:46
msgctxt "gPokeNewsTextGameCorner_Upcoming"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"It's time for POKéMON NEWS.\p"
"It's approaching!\n"
"It's finally coming!\p"
"The GAME CORNER's service day will be\n"
"here in just this many days: {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"Even those who are usually unlucky\n"
"may be lucky on this particular day!\p"
"That's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"
msgstr ""
"大家好！\n"
"宝可梦新闻时间到了。\p"
"就快到了！\n"
"终于要来了！\p"
"游戏城的优惠日\n"
"还有{STR_VAR_1}天就要到了！\p"
"就算是平时运气不好的人，\n"
"在这一天也可能会走运哦！\p"
"以上就是宝可梦新闻。$"

#: data/text/pokemon_news.inc:57
msgctxt "gPokeNewsTextGameCorner_Ongoing"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"It's time for POKéMON NEWS.\p"
"It's here!\n"
"It's finally arrived!\p"
"GAME CORNER's service day has finally\n"
"arrived!\p"
"Could you be lucky at the SLOTS \n"
"and ROULETTE?\p"
"The location is MAUVILLE CITY.\n"
"This is the place!\p"
"That's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"
msgstr ""
"大家好！\n"
"宝可梦新闻时间到了。\p"
"来了！\n"
"终于来了！\p"
"游戏城的优惠日\n"
"终于到来了！\p"
"你能在老虎机和轮盘上\n"
"交上好运吗？\p"
"地点就在紫堇市。\n"
"就是那里！\p"
"以上就是宝可梦新闻。$"

